8:T662,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does GravityCart sell through retailers or regional dealers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Every GC-SPORT-01 chassis and every replacement assembly (GC-SKI-200, GC-FRK-100, GC-BRK-180) ships direct from GravityCart through this storefront. There is no third-party retail or dealer network — this keeps the certification chain of custody intact from assembly to buyer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which regions is the Gravity Cart Sport certified for?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The GC-SPORT-01 chassis is documented against ECE 2006/42/EG and ISO EN 12100 / ISO EN 4210, the machinery and safety directives referenced across the EU. The Shimano Dual Brake Kit (GC-BRK-180) is separately tested to ECE R100, a UNECE braking standard recognized across the EU and other UNECE-contracting markets."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I order replacement parts like the fork, ski kit or brake kit on their own?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The Stainless Steel Fork (GC-FRK-100), Ski Assembly Kit (GC-SKI-200) and Shimano Dual Brake Kit (GC-BRK-180) are each sold as standalone SKUs through this storefront, independent of a full GC-SPORT-01 order."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is availability limited by season or region?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No — the GC-SPORT-01 is a single convertible chassis with certified wheel and ski assemblies included, so the same order covers pavement, gravel and packed-snow use rather than a region- or season-specific model."}}]}0:{"P":null,"b":"yNmA_oew2rdrZXTCE1_6K","p":"","c":["","availability"],"i":false,"f":[[["",{"children":["availability",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/7685a5a8d879318d.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined","nonce":"$undefine